<main class="w">
<section id="about" class="rv"><h2>About</h2>
<p>My name is Aarron Warnagiris — born in 2001, and fascinated by tech for as long as I can remember. As a kid I used to take apart all my electronics just to see how they worked, then try to put them back together again. My dad fed right into it: he loved computers, always said they were the future, and had me learning right alongside him.</p>
<p>My family name is Lithuanian — originally spelled <b>Varnagiris</b>, with a V. The V became a W on the way to the US; I'll be changing it back eventually.</p>
<p>I also love playing video games. These days I lead large-scale event operations as Director of Major Events &amp; Special Projects at Sentry Event Services, Inc., and I'm studying Computer Software Engineering through Coursera (since July 2025) — working toward my goal of becoming a full-stack software developer and one day successfully running a Studio/Software Company.</p>
</section>
<section id="experience" class="rv"><p class="kick">The road so far</p><h2>Experience</h2>
<div class="tl">
{exp.map(e=>(<div class={'it'+(e.featured?' f':'')}><h3>{e.role}</h3>{e.url?<a class="org" href={e.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{e.org}</a>:<div class="org">{e.org}</div>}<div class="d">{e.dates}</div>{e.pts.length>0&&<ul>{e.pts.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>}</div>))}
</div>
<details><summary>Earlier experience</summary><div class="tl" style="margin-top:14px">
{earlier.map(e=>(<div class="it"><h3>{e[0]}{e[1]&&<span class="org"> · {e[1]}</span>}</h3><div class="d">{e[2]}</div>{e[3]&&e[3].length>0&&<ul>{e[3].map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ul>}</div>))}
</div></details>
</section>
<section id="projects" class="rv"><p class="kick">What I've built</p><h2>Projects</h2><div class="grid">
{projects.map(p=>(<div class="c"><h3>{p.name}</h3><p>{p.desc}</p><p class="pl"><a href={p.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit site</a>{p.code&&<a href={p.code} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a>}</p></div>))}
</div><p class="more">More on <a href={gh} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p></section>
